'''Rune''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading. 
== Appearance ==
Its blade is dark purple, nearly black, with a swirly design that consists of a purple electric current. The edge of the blade and guard are also dark purple, but contains an electrifying, glowing strip of a lighter shade of purple. The handle takes the same design as the blade, but in the center of it is a luminous purple rune symbol, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*This knife appeared as the [[Murder Mystery 2]] icon for a period of time.
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

